  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stained-glass-ultra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jocYHF0.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/metals-ultra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8PBAy1i.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TdrUg8F.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HBIYRVa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1199\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Create Ultra 为 Create 模组添加了手工制作的 PBR 纹理（反射、金属度、光照、法线贴图）。</p>\n<p>专为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 打造，但同样适用于所有支持 labPBR 的着色器。请安装&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iris-flywheel-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris &amp; Oculus Flywheel Compat</a> 以在启用着色器的情况下运行 Create。请确保在着色器设置中已启用“labPBR”。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SCms1Cc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1198\" height=\"1192\"></p>",
